{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今日（11月18日）JR東日本舉辦記者會，宣布早前suica吉祥物的投票結果！選項B的紫色兔仔從一開始已經呼聲很高，最後總望所歸獲得冠軍，成為suica企鵝的接班人，預計2027年春天開始上班！今次投票總數超過160萬人，可見日本人和網民都很重視今次的結果！官方指，兔子暫時沒有名字，現在開始招募名稱的投稿，歡迎大家發揮創意！大家對於這位新吉祥物，印象如何呢？\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886305885178_19948383786afd5b3fa7fde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886305885178_19948383786afd5b3fa7fde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：日テレ)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886491934346_3287617636afd5b417c1cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886491934346_3287617636afd5b417c1cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：日テレ)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886699513985_2658121116afd5b43492df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886699513985_2658121116afd5b43492df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：日テレ)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886849446830_11130441846afd5b44eb463.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179498886849446830_11130441846afd5b44eb463.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：日テレ)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df3xWDjkg_I/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.594685+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:27.626698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:28.714677+00:00","content_hash":"f8fa518a98f7f33df19cc3392622cb6112153ceaaf2f48215583d348a148107c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}